<title>UKRAINE: Hryvnia edged down to 1.7910 per dlr in Kiev.</title>
<headline>Hryvnia edged down to 1.7910 per dlr in Kiev.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The hryvnia edged down to 1.7910 per dollar on the Ukrainian Interbank Currency Exchange from 1.7650 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    February 24	   February 21</p>
<p> Hryvnia rate to dollar	  1.7910		  1.7650</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $27.15 million	    $0.00 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
</text>
